WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
This is a rather long English sentence that exceeds the per-line character limit we configured for the checker

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.000
Too short dwell time here.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:09.400
This cue crams far too many words into barely eight hundred ms of time

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:12.900
A normal cue with enough reading time.

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:15.300
Boundary reallocation moves some words across

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:18.600
these two cues with ease when the time gap is small.

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:22.100
Final cue is fine and reading stays comfortable.
